      "content": {
        "json": "# Change log\n\n**Azure revision tracking / Registro de revisões do Azure:** Before saving a new editorial version, copy the currently published Azure revision ID from the workbook revision history into that row's **Previous published revision**. Azure generates a new revision ID after saving; use it for the next update, not this row. Resource IDs, Azure revision IDs, editorial versions and Git commits are separate identifiers. The IDs recorded here refer to the reference deployment, not every deployment of this template. GitHub publication alone does not update the deployed workbook. **Not recovered / Não recuperada** means the historical ID was not recorded and could not be recovered from the available Azure revision history; it is not replaced with a guessed or current ID.\n\nAntes de salvar uma nova versão editorial, copie o ID da revisão atualmente publicada do histórico do workbook no Azure para **Previous published revision** dessa nova linha. O Azure gera outro ID após salvar; use-o na próxima atualização, não nesta linha. O ID do recurso, o ID da revisão Azure, a versão editorial e o commit Git são identificadores distintos. Os IDs registrados referem-se à implantação de referência, não a todas as implantações do template. Publicar no GitHub não atualiza o workbook implantado. **Not recovered / Não recuperada** indica que o ID histórico não foi registrado e não pôde ser recuperado do histórico disponível no Azure; nenhum ID foi inventado ou reutilizado.\n\n| Date and time (UTC) | Editorial version | Change | Previous published revision |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-11-11 04:00 | 2.4.7 | **Validation:** the PAYG change history now also lists property changes of the SQLServerLicense resource (for the physical core license scenario, for example billingPlan Paid to PAYG) with a Kind column; the create/delete table is limited to Create and Delete. No new query. License property names in resourcechanges not verified; portal rendering not verified. Validacoes: o historico de mudancas PAYG tambem lista mudancas de propriedades do recurso SQLServerLicense (cenario de licenca de nucleos fisicos, por exemplo billingPlan de Paid para PAYG) com coluna Kind; a tabela de criacao/exclusao ficou limitada a Create e Delete. Nenhuma consulta nova. Nomes das propriedades da licenca no resourcechanges nao verificados; renderizacao no portal nao verificada. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-11 03:00 | 2.4.6 | **Validation:** new section PAYG change history, based on the ARG resourcechanges table: when the SQL extension LicenseType, UsePhysicalCoreLicense, ESU or consent setting changed (before/after, who, client) and when the SQL extension or SQLServerLicense was created or deleted. Guided step 8 points to it. Two read-only queries; retention window not verified; portal rendering not verified. Validacoes: nova secao Historico de mudancas PAYG, baseada na tabela resourcechanges do ARG: quando LicenseType, UsePhysicalCoreLicense, ESU ou consentimento da extensao SQL mudou (antes/depois, quem, cliente) e quando a extensao SQL ou SQLServerLicense foi criada ou excluida. O passo 8 do guia aponta para ela. Duas consultas somente leitura; janela de retencao nao verificada; renderizacao no portal nao verificada. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-11 02:00 | 2.4.5 | **How to use:** the quick path became an 8-step guided path (scope, baseline, fix the base, triage, cores, prerequisites, script dry run, pilot), each step with where to look, what to do and when it is done; buttons follow the steps; priority text now includes hosts without an Arc machine in ARG; tab table lists SQL on Azure VMs. Text only, no query changed. Como usar: o caminho rapido virou um caminho guiado de 8 passos (escopo, linha de base, corrigir a base, triagem, nucleos, pre-requisitos, simulacao do script, piloto), cada passo com onde olhar, o que fazer e quando esta pronto; botoes seguem os passos; texto de prioridade inclui hosts sem maquina Arc no ARG; tabela de abas inclui SQL em VMs Azure. Somente texto, nenhuma consulta alterada. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-11 01:00 | 2.4.4 | **Summary/Inventory:** new tile *Hosts with Arc machine in ARG*; *No Arc machine in ARG* renamed *Instance without Arc machine (stale?)*; Inventory gets *LastInstanceInventory* and the flag *No Arc machine (stale instance?)*; note explains the lab observation (portal says the machine was not found while mode shows Connected). Resumo/Inventario: novo bloco Hosts com maquina Arc no ARG; Sem maquina Arc no ARG renomeado para Instancia sem maquina Arc (residual?); Inventario ganha LastInstanceInventory e o sinal Sem maquina Arc (instancia residual?); nota explica a observacao do lab. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-11 00:10 | 2.4.3 | **Summary:** the *Arc not connected* tile no longer counts hosts whose Arc machine is absent from ARG (it counted them, inflating the number); new tile *No Arc machine in ARG*; *Arc SQL hosts* renamed *Hosts with SQL instances*. Inventory note now describes rows without Arc machine. Resumo: Arc desconectado nao conta mais hosts sem maquina Arc no ARG; novo bloco Sem maquina Arc no ARG; Hosts Arc SQL renomeado para Hosts com instancia SQL. Nota do Inventario descreve linhas sem maquina Arc. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 23:59 | 2.4.2 | SQL on Azure VMs tab: the values `NotSet` (license type) and `Unknown` (edition) returned by the API are shown as Not reported; the note says so. Aba SQL em VMs Azure: valores NotSet e Unknown retornados pela API aparecem como Not reported; a nota informa isso. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 23:59 | 2.4.1 | **Text only:** PAYG review tab note now has a reading order, the priority rule (High/Medium/OK), a column legend and notes on hosts without Arc machine and on free/test editions. Somente texto: nota da aba Revisao PAYG com ordem de leitura, regra de prioridade, legenda de colunas e notas sobre hosts sem maquina Arc e edicoes gratuitas. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 23:50 | 2.4.0 | **New tab SQL on Azure VMs / SQL em VMs Azure:** license type summary and review list for `Microsoft.SqlVirtualMachine` (PAYG, AHUB, DR), free editions listed separately. Property names and values checked with scripts/Test-ArcWorkbookContract.ps1 against the 2023-10-01 spec. Nova aba SQL em VMs Azure: resumo e lista de revisão por tipo de licença (PAYG, AHUB, DR). | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 23:30 | 2.3.3 | **SQLServerLicense validation:** removed the `Scope` column (`properties.scope`), which is not in the SqlServerLicense API spec (the documented fields are `scopeType` and `tenantId`); checked with scripts/Test-ArcWorkbookContract.ps1. Validacao de SQLServerLicense: coluna Scope removida (propriedade fora do spec). | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 23:00 | 2.3.2 | **Language parameter:** removed the non-standard `defaultValue` and the per-item `selected` flags, which appear to make the portal offer a *Default items* choice that sets a value outside EN/PT (red parameter; not reproduced outside the portal). The initial value is now English, same as the agent-support workbook (options: English and Português). Idioma inicial agora English (como no agent-support); parametro Language sem `defaultValue`/`selected`: a opcao *Default items* gerava valor invalido. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-10 21:00 | 2.3.1 | **Review follow-up / Revisao:** indexof in extension-to-host joins is case-insensitive; ESU hint no longer hard-codes a date (see guide); status icons and bars in grids. indexof sem distincao de maiusculas; dica de ESU sem data fixa; icones de status e barras. | To be filled before saving / Preencher antes de salvar |\n| 2026-11-06 22:45 | 2.3.0 | **Core estimate / Estimativa de nucleos:** Standard capacity is version-aware (24 through 2022, 32 for 2025); unknown editions remain unknown. Capacity is explicitly not a billing meter, including per-host recommendations. Host grids preserve id for ARG paging. Harness completeness and subset validation corrected. Capacidade Standard por versao, desconhecidos preservados, recomendacoes sem teto de cobranca e paginacao por id. | `6bc0d438a72a4640a0333496de5f0302` |\n| 2026-11-03 01:27 | 2.2.3 | **Revision tracking / Registro de revisões:** recorded the previously published Azure revision; historical gaps marked explicitly; before-save workflow clarified. Revisão anterior registrada; lacunas históricas identificadas; fluxo antes de salvar esclarecido. No query changed / Nenhuma consulta alterada. | `ead30319b3554eca9eed11985b6bcd31` |\n| 2026-11-02 21:10 | 2.2.2 | **Quick path now has direct links:** buttons jump to Summary, PAYG review and Validation; steps 4–6 link to the script, README, Learn PAYG/auto-deploy pages and Cost Management. No query changed. | Not recovered / Não recuperada |\n| 2026-10-31 03:10 | 2.2.1 | Rebuilt from a single shared base query, shortened after portal test (smaller queries, no regex), single bilingual tab bar. Fixed core estimate (per OSE, min 4, Standard max 24, free editions 0, Linux HADR billed active); backlog no longer lists healthy PAYG hosts; flags that LicenseOnly, Server+CAL and pCore hosts would be converted by the script; CSP consent path (Policy or modify-license-type); Arc SQL tab names and bilingual columns; priority column; tiles and charts; grids up to 10,000 rows with search; new checks for ESU 2014/2016, connectivity over 30 days, CSP subscriptions and pCore alignment; corrected references. No SQL servers, licenses or billing were modified. | Not recovered / Não recuperada |\n| 2026-10-30 04:53 | 2.1 | Removed the redundant one-choice Machine source dropdown. Arc scope is now a literal in all 13 queries; language and the single tab bar remain unchanged. No SQL servers, licenses or billing were modified. | `2e9e4d3f82904e49b8f60ef8758dd26a` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:43 | 2.0 | Restored a single tab control after duplicated bilingual link IDs broke navigation; machine selection now offers Azure Arc only. English/Português guidance remains available. Queries, machines and licenses unchanged. | `25747d8c45bc407eab941e6d186bdf8b` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:38 | 1.9 | Added English/Português selection and localized editorial content; tab control regression identified and superseded by 2.0. | `e4d1ca5795344342bc6d4ad34a068caa` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:17 | 1.8 | Marked Azure Arc as the dropdown default with selected=true and added optional All items (Arc + Azure VM) for six instance-derived views. Arc-only evidence stays Arc-scoped in All; version breakdown now identifies the source. Updated scope guidance. No servers or licenses changed. | `ad59b023f6654d4a88f4b0e7f35ac80b` |\n| 2026-10-30 04:02 | 1.7 | Fixed the External validations editorial note visibility: SelectedTab isEqualTo now compares the scalar Validation rather than the obsolete Validation/NewQueryItem array. No query, license or server changed. | `ae63d04d0b044533a9935de9b02418cb` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:39 | 1.6 | Fixed two source-filter leaks found by executing the queries: architecture now requires an Arc machine container ID, and auto-deploy tags apply the Arc-only guard after both union branches. Other queries and licensing resources unchanged. | `630bd6ea957b425da5f0e038927746a5` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:27 | 1.5 | Added Machine source control (Azure Arc default, Azure VM optional): filtered six instance-derived views by container resource type and kept seven Arc-only evidence views empty for Azure VM selection. Added scope guidance; no server or licensing configuration changed. | `42e40b2896c040af937b1f551203e776` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:15 | 1.4 | Replaced the permanent Change log tab with an edit-mode Show changelog Yes/No control (default No; hidden when locked); moved this text item beneath the controls. No KQL or licensing guidance changed. | `dd717b54a62242e6b822e5552f102fdf` |\n| 2026-10-30 03:08 | 1.3 | Aligned the Arc selection tile to official script source (pinned commit e1163bff690e): publisher-only filter, no automatic wave; changed the former first-wave tile into a reconciliation backlog. Distinguished Azure VM SQL instance inventory from Arc hosts and refreshed related summary/guidance. No SQL Server license configuration changed. | `4199258921094b5cbe044eec6b63bb2c` |\n| 2026-10-30 02:58 | 1.2 | Added this visible Change log tab and removed the hidden editor-only note. No query or licensing guidance changes. | `2629546c6dcc416f8ce66aec5f1fc9f5` |\n| 2026-10-30 02:52 | 1.1 | Moved the initial log to an editor-only Markdown reference; not visible without opening the text source. Superseded by version 1.2. | `cf07f00b04344b3fbcff5edde95928c7` |\n| 2026-10-30 02:50 | 1.0 | Started the change log in the workbook text; no query changes. Superseded by version 1.2. | `abe408be553b4f02ae8b7de0c7e924f0` |\n\n**For the next change:** record the UTC date/time, next editorial version, what changed, and the revision that was published *before* your save. Azure retains its own revision IDs and timestamps separately."
