f('{Language}'=='PT', 'VM em outro provedor; ', 'Other-cloud VM; '), ''))\n| where PriorityNum <= 2 or (ScriptCode != 'MATCH' and HostLicenseType != 'PAYG')\n| order by PriorityNum asc, MachineName asc\n| project id=HostId, Priority, MachineName=iff(isempty(MachineName), HostId, MachineName), ScriptSelection, NextAction, HostLicenseType, ArcStatus, SqlDiscovered, ExtensionState, UsePhysicalCoreLicense, ServerCALInstances, HadrInstances, FreeOrTestInstances, EsuVersionInstances, ResourceGroup, SubscriptionId, ValidationFlags\n",
