      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Complete exportable inventory\nOne row per **host ID** that has SQL instance resources. Rows with an Arc machine show its status and cores. Rows where the machine **does not exist in Azure Resource Graph for the selected subscriptions** show only the ID, `UNKNOWN`, the flag *No Arc machine (stale instance?)* and the *LastInstanceInventory* date. Observed in the lab on 2026-11-10: for such an instance the portal reports that the Arc machine resource was not found, yet the instance still shows mode `Connected` with an old inventory upload date, so its `Connected` status is not reliable. Cause (for example a deleted machine) is not verified in Microsoft Learn. Cores come from the machine, so these hosts have none. Validate in the SQL Instance -> Container exceptions table of the Reconciliation workbook; removing the stale instance resource is a customer action outside this workbook. Machines with SQL discovered but no instance resource appear only in **Validations**. Core values are estimates, not billing.\n"
            },
            "name": "inventory_note",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "EN"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Inventário completo para exportação\nUma linha por **ID de host** que tem recursos de instância SQL. Linhas com máquina Arc mostram status e núcleos. Linhas em que a máquina **não existe no Azure Resource Graph para as assinaturas selecionadas** mostram só o ID, `UNKNOWN`, o sinal *Sem máquina Arc (instância residual?)* e a data *LastInstanceInventory*. Observado no lab em 10/11/2026: para uma instância assim o portal informa que o recurso da máquina Arc não foi encontrado, mas a instância ainda mostra modo `Connected` com data antiga de carga de inventário; portanto o `Connected` dela não é confiável. A causa (por exemplo, máquina excluída) não foi verificada na Microsoft Learn. Os núcleos vêm da máquina, então esses hosts não têm núcleos. Valide na tabela de exceções Instância SQL -> Contêiner do workbook de Reconciliação; remover o recurso residual da instância é ação do cliente, fora deste workbook. Máquinas com SQL detectado mas sem recurso de instância aparecem só em **Validações**. Núcleos são estimativas, não cobrança.\n"
            },
            "name": "inventory_note-pt",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "PT"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances'\n| extend HostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n| where HostId contains '/providers/microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/'\n| extend Edition=tostring(properties.edition), Version=tostring(properties.version), InstanceLicenseType=tostring(properties.licenseType)\n| extend EditionRank = case(Edition has 'Enterprise', 6, Edition has 'Standard', 5, Edition has 'Web', 4, Edition has 'Express', 3, Edition has 'Developer', 2, Edition has 'Evaluation', 1, 0)\n| extend SqlVersionMajor = case(Version has 'SQL Server 2014' or Version startswith '12.', 'SQL Server 2014', Version has 'SQL Server 2016' or Version startswith '13.', 'SQL Server 2016', Version has 'SQL Server 2017' or Version startswith '14.', 'SQL Server 2017', Version has 'SQL Server 2019' or Version startswith '15.', 'SQL Server 2019', Version has 'SQL Server 2022' or Version startswith '16.', 'SQL Server 2022', Version has 'SQL Server 2025' or Version startswith '17.', 'SQL Server 2025', isnotempty(Version), Version, 'Not identified')\n| summarize Instances=count(), ActiveInstances=countif(InstanceLicenseType !~ 'HADR'), HadrInstances=countif(InstanceLicenseType =~ 'HADR'), FreeOrTestInstances=countif(Edition has 'Developer' or Edition has 'Evaluation' or Edition has 'Express'), ServerCALInstances=countif(InstanceLicenseType =~ 'ServerCAL'), EsuVersionInstances=countif(SqlVersionMajor in ('SQL Server 2014','SQL Server 2016')), TopEditionRank=max(EditionRank), StandardCoreLimit=max(iff(Edition has 'Standard', iff(SqlVersionMajor == 'SQL Server 2025', 32, 24), 0)), Editions=make_set(Edition), Versions=make_set(SqlVersionMajor), InstanceLicenseTypes=make_set(InstanceLicenseType), LastInstanceInventory=max(todatetime(properties.lastInventoryUploadTime)) by HostId\n| extend TopEdition = case(TopEditionRank == 6, 'Enterprise', TopEditionRank == 5, 'Standard', TopEditionRank == 4, 'Web', TopEditionRank == 3, 'Express', TopEditionRank == 2, 'Developer', TopEditionRank == 1, 'Evaluation', 'Not identified')\n| extend HadrOnlySignal = Instances > 0 and ActiveInstances == 0\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines'\n    | extend HostId = tolower(id)\n    | project HostId, MachineName=tostring(name), ArcStatus=tostring(properties.status), SqlDiscovered=tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered), LogicalCoreCount=toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount), PhysicalCoreCount=toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount), SocketCount=toint(properties.detectedProperties.processorCount), Manufacturer=tostring(properties.detectedProperties.manufacturer), HardwareModel=tostring(properties.detectedProperties.model), OsType=tostring(properties.osType), OsName=tostring(properties.osName), LastStatusChange=todatetime(properties.lastStatusChange), MachineRG=resourceGroup, MachineSub=subscriptionId\n) on HostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions'\n    | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ 'Microsoft.AzureData'\n    | where tostring(properties.type) in~ ('WindowsAgent.SqlServer','LinuxAgent.SqlServer')\n    | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(tolower(id), '/extensions')))\n    | extend HostLicenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n    | extend HostLicenseType = case(HostLicenseTypeRaw =~ 'PAYG', 'PAYG', HostLicenseTypeRaw =~ 'Paid', 'Paid', HostLicenseTypeRaw =~ 'LicenseOnly', 'LicenseOnly', isempty(HostLicenseTypeRaw), 'Not reported', HostLicenseTypeRaw)\n    | extend UsePhysicalCoreLicenseRaw = tostring(properties.settings.UsePhysicalCoreLicense.IsApplied)\n    | extend UsePhysicalCoreLicense = case(UsePhysicalCoreLicenseRaw =~ 'true', 'Applied', UsePhysicalCoreLicenseRaw =~ 'false', 'Not applied', 'Not reported')\n    | project HostId, ExtensionState=tostring(properties.provisioningState), ExtensionVersion=tostring(properties.typeHandlerVersion), HostLicenseType, EnableESU=tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates), UsePhysicalCoreLicense, RecurringPAYGConsent=tostring(properties.settings.ConsentToRecurringPAYG.Consented), RecurringPAYGConsentTimestamp=tostring(properties.settings.ConsentToRecurringPAYG.ConsentTimestamp)\n) on HostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions'\n    | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ 'Microsoft.AzureData'\n    | where tostring(properties.provisioningState) == 'Succeeded'\n    | where tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType) != 'PAYG'\n    | extend HostId=tolower(substring(id,0,indexof(id,'/extensions')))\n    | summarize ScriptExtensionMatches=count(), ScriptMatchedExtensionTypes=make_set(tostring(properties.type)) by HostId\n) on HostId\n| extend HostLicenseType=coalesce(HostLicenseType,'Not reported'), UsePhysicalCoreLicense=coalesce(UsePhysicalCoreLicense,'Not reported'), ScriptExtensionMatches=coalesce(ScriptExtensionMatches,0)\n| extend ResourceGroup=coalesce(MachineRG, tostring(split(HostId,'/')[4])), SubscriptionId=coalesce(MachineSub, tostring(split(HostId,'/')[2]))\n| extend IsLinux = OsType =~ 'linux'\n| extend HwText = tolower(strcat(HardwareModel, ' ', Manufacturer))\n| extend IsVm = HwText contains 'virtual' or HwText contains 'vmware' or HwText contains 'kvm' or HwText contains 'hvm' or HwText contains 'standard pc' or HwText contains 'google' or HwText contains 'nutanix' or HwText contains 'openstack' or HwText contains 'amazon' or HwText contains 'bhyve' or HwText contains 'xen' or HwText contains 'qemu' or HwText contains 'innotek' or HwText contains 'red hat'\n| extend ForeignCloud = HwText contains 'amazon' or HwText contains 'google'\n| extend FormFactor = case(IsVm, 'VM', isnotempty(HardwareModel) and isnotempty(Manufacturer), 'PHYSICAL', 'UNKNOWN')\n| extend RawCores = iff(FormFactor == 'PHYSICAL', coalesce(PhysicalCoreCount, LogicalCoreCount), coalesce(LogicalCoreCount, PhysicalCoreCount))\n| extend CoreEstimate = case(\n    TopEdition in ('Express','Developer','Evaluation') or (HadrOnlySignal and not(IsLinux)), tolong(0),\n    TopEdition == 'Not identified' or isnull(RawCores) or RawCores <= 0, long(null),\n    TopEdition == 'Standard', tolong(max_of(4, min_of(RawCores, StandardCoreLimit))),\n    tolong(max_of(4, RawCores)))\n| extend ReviewCode = case(\n    HostLicenseType == 'Paid' and TopEdition in ('Enterprise','Standard') and ActiveInstances > 0, 'PAID_REVIEW',\n    HostLicenseType == 'Paid' and HadrOnlySignal, 'PAID_HADR',\n    HostLicenseType == 'PAYG', 'ALREADY_PAYG',\n    HostLicenseType == 'LicenseOnly', 'LICENSEONLY',\n    HostLicenseType == 'Not reported', 'NOT_REPORTED',\n    FreeOrTestInstances > 0, 'FREE_TEST',\n    'REVIEW')\n| extend ScriptCode = case(isempty(MachineName), 'NO_MACHINE', SqlDiscovered !~ 'true', 'NO_DISCOVERY', ScriptExtensionMatches > 0, 'MATCH', 'NO_EXT')\n| extend RiskIfConverted = ScriptCode == 'MATCH' and (HostLicenseType =~ 'LicenseOnly' or ServerCALInstances > 0 or UsePhysicalCoreLicense == 'Applied')\n| extend PriorityNum = case(\n    isempty(MachineName) or ArcStatus !~ 'Connected' or isempty(ExtensionState) or ExtensionState !~ 'Succeeded' or RiskIfConverted, 1,\n    HadrInstances > 0 or FreeOrTestInstances > 0 or HostLicenseType == 'Not reported' or SqlDiscovered !~ 'true' or (EsuVersionInstances > 0 and EnableESU !~ 'true') or ForeignCloud or ServerCALInstances > 0, 2,\n    3)\n| extend Priority = case(PriorityNum == 1, iff('{Language}'=='PT', '🔴 Alta', '🔴 High'), PriorityNum == 2, iff('{Language}'=='PT', '🟠 Média', '🟠 Medium'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', '🟢 OK', '🟢 OK'))\n| extend ReviewScope = case(ReviewCode == 'PAID_REVIEW', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Paid Ent/Std - revisar', 'Paid Ent/Std - review'), ReviewCode == 'PAID_HADR', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Paid só HA/DR', 'Paid HA/DR only'), ReviewCode == 'ALREADY_PAYG', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Já PAYG', 'Already PAYG'), ReviewCode == 'LICENSEONLY', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseOnly', 'LicenseOnly'), ReviewCode == 'NOT_REPORTED', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseType não definido', 'LicenseType not set'), ReviewCode == 'FREE_TEST', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Gratuita/teste', 'Free/test'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Revisar', 'Review'))\n| extend ScriptSelection = case(ScriptCode == 'MATCH', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Script selecionaria', 'Script would select'), ScriptCode == 'NO_MACHINE', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Não: sem máquina Arc', 'No: no Arc machine'), ScriptCode == 'NO_DISCOVERY', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Não: SQL não detectado', 'No: SQL not discovered'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Não: sem extensão não-PAYG', 'No: no non-PAYG extension'))\n| extend WouldConvert = iff(ScriptCode == 'MATCH', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Sim', 'Yes'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Não', 'No'))\n| extend ConversionRisk = strcat(iff(ScriptCode == 'MATCH' and HostLicenseType == 'LicenseOnly', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseOnly para PAYG; ', 'LicenseOnly to PAYG; '), ''), iff(ScriptCode == 'MATCH' and ServerCALInstances > 0, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Server+CAL para PAYG; ', 'Server+CAL to PAYG; '), ''), iff(ScriptCode == 'MATCH' and UsePhysicalCoreLicense == 'Applied', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'pCore seria desativado; ', 'pCore would be unset; '), ''))\n| extend NextAction = case(ScriptCode == 'MATCH' and RiskIfConverted, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Não incluir: limitar por assinatura/RG e corrigir antes', 'Do not include as is: limit by sub/RG and fix first'), ScriptCode == 'MATCH', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Candidato: rodar -ReportOnly e piloto', 'Candidate: run -ReportOnly, then pilot'), HostLicenseType == 'PAYG' and ArcStatus =~ 'Connected', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'PAYG: conferir uso e Cost Management', 'PAYG: check usage and Cost Management'), HostLicenseType == 'PAYG', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'PAYG offline: restaurar Arc em até 30 dias', 'PAYG offline: restore Arc within 30 days'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Corrigir máquina, descoberta ou extensão', 'Fix machine, discovery or extension'))\n| extend ValidationFlags = strcat(iff(isempty(MachineName), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Sem máquina Arc (instância residual?); ', 'No Arc machine (stale instance?); '), ''), iff(ArcStatus !~ 'Connected' and isnotempty(MachineName), strcat('Arc: ',ArcStatus,'; '), ''), iff(isempty(ExtensionState), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Sem extensão SQL; ', 'No SQL extension; '), ''), iff(ExtensionState !~ 'Succeeded' and isnotempty(ExtensionState), strcat('Ext: ',ExtensionState,'; '), ''), iff(HostLicenseType == 'PAYG', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Já PAYG; ', 'Already PAYG; '), ''), iff(HostLicenseType == 'Paid', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Paid: validar SA; ', 'Paid: validate SA; '), ''), iff(HostLicenseType == 'LicenseOnly', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseOnly seria convertido; ', 'LicenseOnly would convert; '), ''), iff(ServerCALInstances > 0, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Server+CAL: usar LicenseOnly; ', 'Server+CAL: use LicenseOnly; '), ''), iff(HostLicenseType == 'Not reported', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseType não definido; ', 'LicenseType not set; '), ''), iff(UsePhysicalCoreLicense == 'Applied', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'pCore: validar licença e billingPlan; ', 'pCore: check license and billingPlan; '), ''), iff(HadrOnlySignal and IsLinux, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Linux: HADR cobrado como ativo; ', 'Linux: HADR billed active; '), ''), iff(HadrOnlySignal and not(IsLinux), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Só HA/DR: validar passivo; ', 'HA/DR only: validate passive; '), ''), iff(HadrInstances > 0 and ActiveInstances > 0, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Mix ativo+HADR; ', 'Active+HADR mix; '), ''), iff(FreeOrTestInstances > 0, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Edição gratuita/teste; ', 'Free/test edition; '), ''), iff(isnotempty(MachineName) and SqlDiscovered !~ 'true', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Descoberta SQL não true; ', 'SQL discovery not true; '), ''), iff(EsuVersionInstances > 0 and EnableESU !~ 'true', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'SQL 2014/2016 sem ESU; ', 'SQL 2014/2016 no ESU; '), ''), iff(ForeignCloud, iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'VM em outro provedor; ', 'Other-cloud VM; '), ''))\n| order by MachineName asc\n| project id=HostId, MachineName=iff(isempty(MachineName), HostId, MachineName), HostId, ResourceGroup, SubscriptionId, Priority, OsType, OsName, ArcStatus, LastStatusChange, LastInstanceInventory, SqlDiscovered, LogicalCoreCount, PhysicalCoreCount, SocketCount, Manufacturer, HardwareModel, FormFactor, HostLicenseType, UsePhysicalCoreLicense, EnableESU, RecurringPAYGConsent, RecurringPAYGConsentTimestamp, ExtensionState, ExtensionVersion, TopEdition, Editions=tostring(Editions), Versions=tostring(Versions), InstanceLicenseTypes=tostring(InstanceLicenseTypes), Instances, ActiveInstances, HadrInstances, CoreEstimateNotBilling=CoreEstimate, ReviewScope, ScriptSelection, WouldConvert, ConversionRisk, NextAction, ScriptMatchedExtensionTypes=tostring(ScriptMatchedExtensionTypes), ValidationFlags\n",
