    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Validations outside the review logic\n- **CSP consent:** required to enable PAYG in CSP-managed subscriptions; it cannot change without reinstalling the extension. Use tag `PAYG-Recurring` or the Azure Policy; the transition script does not pass it.\n- **Connectivity:** Arc must check in at least every 30 days (enforced from June 2026). After 30 days offline PAYG falls back to recurring billing on the last known configuration with a 30-day backfill. A changed VMID can cause double billing.\n- **ESU:** SQL 2014/2016 need SA or PAYG; LicenseOnly cannot subscribe.\n- **Billing proof:** Cost Management, Service name = Azure Arc-enabled SQL Server, Charge type = Usage, Publisher type = Microsoft; group by Resource or Meter. Charges are not shown on the Arc resource pages.\n- **pCore:** if a physical core license is Paid, switch its billingPlan to PAYG before moving the VMs, so they are not billed individually.\n- **Passive HA/DR:** AG replicas must be non-readable or have no user connections, no standalone databases outside the AG, no associated services; FCI passive node must not run the service. Detection is hourly and unavailable on Linux.\n- **Auto-deploy tag:** checked subscription first, then resource group, then machine; changes can take up to 8 hours. Without a tag, SA customers get Paid automatically.\n"
            },
            "name": "external_validations",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "EN"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Validações fora da lógica de revisão\n- **Consentimento CSP:** exigido para habilitar PAYG em assinaturas CSP; só muda reinstalando a extensão. Use a tag `PAYG-Recurring` ou a Azure Policy; o script de transição não o repassa.\n- **Conectividade:** o Arc precisa fazer check-in ao menos a cada 30 dias (aplicado a partir de junho de 2026). Após 30 dias offline o PAYG passa a cobrança recorrente pela última configuração conhecida, com retroativo de 30 dias. Mudança de VMID pode gerar cobrança duplicada.\n- **ESU:** SQL 2014/2016 exigem SA ou PAYG; LicenseOnly não pode assinar.\n- **Prova de cobrança:** Cost Management, Service name = Azure Arc-enabled SQL Server, Charge type = Usage, Publisher type = Microsoft; agrupe por Resource ou Meter. Os valores não aparecem nas páginas dos recursos Arc.\n- **pCore:** se a licença de núcleos físicos for Paid, mude o billingPlan para PAYG antes de passar as VMs, para que não sejam cobradas individualmente.\n- **HA/DR passivo:** réplicas de AG não legíveis ou sem conexões de usuário, sem bancos fora do AG, sem serviços associados; nó passivo de FCI sem o serviço em execução. Detecção horária e indisponível no Linux.\n- **Tag de implantação automática:** lida em assinatura, depois resource group, depois máquina; até 8 horas para valer. Sem tag, clientes com SA recebem Paid automaticamente.\n"
            },
            "name": "external_validations-pt",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "PT"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Official ARG support checks\nBased on Microsoft Learn: auto-deploy tags, machines with SQL discovered but no extension, ESU gap, connectivity risk, CSP consent, SQLServerLicense and pCore alignment. Use them to explain gaps before any transition.\n"
            },
            "name": "autodeploy_note",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "EN"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Verificações oficiais de apoio no ARG\nBaseadas no Microsoft Learn: tags de implantação automática, máquinas com SQL detectado sem extensão, lacuna de ESU, risco de conectividade, consentimento CSP, SQLServerLicense e alinhamento de pCore. Use-as para explicar lacunas antes de qualquer transição.\n"
            },
            "name": "autodeploy_note-pt",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Language",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "PT"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resourcecontainers\n| where type in~ ('microsoft.resources/subscriptions','microsoft.resources/subscriptions/resourcegroups')\n| extend ScopeType = iff(type =~ 'microsoft.resources/subscriptions', 'Subscription', 'ResourceGroup'), ScopeName = name\n| extend ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment = tostring(tags['ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment'])\n| where isnotempty(ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment)\n| project ScopeType, ScopeName, SubscriptionId=subscriptionId, ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment\n| union (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines'\n    | extend ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment = tostring(tags['ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment'])\n    | where isnotempty(ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment)\n    | project ScopeType='ArcMachine', ScopeName=name, SubscriptionId=subscriptionId, ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment\n)\n| extend Interpretation = case(ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment =~ 'PAYG-Recurring', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'CSP: registra consentimento PAYG recorrente na implantação automática', 'CSP: registers recurring PAYG consent on auto-deploy'), ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment =~ 'PAYG', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'PAYG padrão para novas máquinas', 'PAYG default for new machines'), ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment =~ 'Paid', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Paid padrão (atestado de SA/assinatura)', 'Paid default (SA/subscription attestation)'), ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment =~ 'LicenseOnly', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'LicenseOnly padrão', 'LicenseOnly default'), ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment =~ 'Disabled', iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Implantação automática desativada (cache da tag até 8 horas)', 'Auto-deploy disabled (tag cache up to 8 hours)'), iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'Valor de tag não reconhecido', 'Unrecognized tag value'))\n| order by ScopeType asc, ScopeName asc\n",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Auto-deploy tags / Tags ArcSQLServerExtensionDeployment",
              "noDataMessage": "No rows returned for the selected subscriptions. / Nenhuma linha para as assinaturas selecionadas.",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "rowLimit": 10000,
                "filter": true
              }
            },
            "name": "autodeploy_tags"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines'\n| where tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered) =~ 'true'\n| extend HostId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions'\n    | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ 'Microsoft.AzureData'\n    | where tostring(properties.type) in~ ('WindowsAgent.SqlServer','LinuxAgent.SqlServer')\n    | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(tolower(id), '/extensions')))\n    | summarize SqlExtensionCount=count() by HostId\n) on HostId\n| where isempty(SqlExtensionCount) or SqlExtensionCount == 0\n| project MachineName=name, ArcStatus=tostring(properties.status), ResourceGroup=resourceGroup, SubscriptionId=subscriptionId, Action=iff('{Language}'=='PT', 'SQL detectado pelo Arc mas extensão do Azure para SQL Server não encontrada', 'SQL discovered by Arc but Azure extension for SQL Server not found')\n| order by SubscriptionId, ResourceGroup, MachineName\n",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "SQL discovered, extension missing / SQL detectado sem extensão",
              "noDataMessage": "No rows returned for the selected subscriptions. / Nenhuma linha para as assinaturas selecionadas.",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "rowLimit": 10000,
                "filter": true,
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ArcStatus",
                    "formatter": 18,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                      "thresholdsGrid": [
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Connected",
                          "representation": "success",
                          "text": "{0}{1}"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Disconnected",
                          "representation": "warning",
                          "text": "{0}{1}"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Expired",
                          "representation": "warning",
                          "text": "{0}{1}"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "Default",
                          "thresholdValue": null,
                          "representation": "unknown",
                          "text": "{0}{1}"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "name": "missing_sql_extension"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
