              "json": "## PAYG change history (before and after)\nReads the Azure Resource Graph `resourcechanges` table (Microsoft Learn: [get resource changes](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/governance/resource-graph/changes/get-resource-changes), checked on 2026-11-10). It lets you see, inside the workbook, when the SQL extension setting `LicenseType` or `UsePhysicalCoreLicense` changed and from which value, so you do not need to export a snapshot by hand for recent changes. Limits: Learn says change records are usually available in under five minutes; the retention window is **not verified** (about 10 days of data were seen in one lab on 2026-11-10); a property that is new is not listed as a change, and deleted resources have no snapshot. For evidence older than the window keep the CSV snapshots from `Export-ArcSqlPaygSnapshot.ps1`. For the physical core license scenario (unlimited virtualization) the first table also lists property changes of the `SQLServerLicense` resource (for example `billingPlan` Paid to PAYG), not only the extension settings; which license property names appear in `resourcechanges` is not verified. The table shows configuration changes only; it does not prove billing.\n"
